  "207066b9-f0ed-f84d-98b1-75b115b0e97c"],
 ", the Fox derivative denoted by ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   ButtonBox["FoxD",
    BaseStyle->"Link",
    ButtonData->"paclet:Taggar/FinitelyPresentedGroups/ref/FoxD"], "[", 
